<title>USA: Caledonia, Wis., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Caledonia, Wis., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $7.430 million of Caledonia, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, with a true interest cost of 4.6142 percent.</p>
